## M6 (GNN, cluster HT, P6/P7): met for release
The baselines are in, one architecture, untuned, 13 of 14 cells, 50 draws, said so in the text and limitations. The corner-interpretation claim is now worded as a hypothesis formed after a failed prediction ("the tests that followed did not confirm it"); the confirmatory block of the noise-adjusted score is reported as inconclusive and the honest-interval arm as coverage by width; the true-curvature arm is labelled exploratory, infeasible, grid-floor kappa. The text no longer claims more than the evidence.

